    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32086" root="غطو and غطى" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَغْطِىٌّ</span></b>  A thing <i>covered,</i> or <i>concealed,</i> &amp;c. (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence] one says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ مَغْطِىٌّ القِنَاعِ</span>, meaning
(assumed tropical:)  <i>He is obscure in respect of reputation.</i> (TA.)

